stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Menu

    Menu --> Setup: [Enter / Space]\nselect pattern
    Menu --> History: [h]\nview history
    Menu --> Menu: [j / ↓]\nscroll down
    Menu --> Menu: [k / ↑]\nscroll up
    Menu --> Menu: [b]\ntoggle beeping
    Menu --> Quitting: [q]\nquit

    Setup --> Session: [Enter / Space]\nstart session
    Setup --> Setup: [Tab]\nswitch field
    Setup --> Setup: [+]\nincrease value
    Setup --> Setup: [-]\ndecrease value
    Setup --> Menu: [Esc]\ncancel setup

    Session --> Results: [session complete]\ntarget duration reached
    Session --> Results: [e]\nend early
    Session --> Session: [p / Space]\npause/resume
    Session --> Session: [b]\ntoggle audio beep
    Session --> Quitting: [q / Ctrl+C]\nabandon session

    Results --> Menu: [Enter / Esc]\nreturn to menu
    Results --> Menu: [s]\nsave session

    History --> History: [j / ↓]\nscroll down
    History --> History: [k / ↑]\nscroll up
    History --> Menu: [Esc]\nback to menu

    Quitting --> [*]

    note right of Menu
        selected_pattern_idx
        tracks cursor position
    end note

    note right of Setup
        duration_minutes: 1-60
        tempo: 0.5x - 2.0x
        selected_field: Duration | Tempo
    end note

    note right of Session
        SessionManager wraps BreathingEngine
        Engine ticks every 100ms
        Phases auto-transition
        Pause toggles is_paused flag
    end note

    note right of Results
        Metrics calculated:
        - cycles completed
        - total duration
        - completion %
        - pauses count
    end note
